# Yango

> Yango transforms global technologies into localized everyday services for regional communities across 30+ countries in the Middle East, Latin America, Africa, Europe, and beyond. The company operates a digital ecosystem that includes ride-hailing, delivery, entertainment, and business solutions, adapting each service to meet unique local needs and cultural preferences. Yango partners with businesses to provide advanced tools for growth while investing in community development through education programs and career initiatives.

## Consumer Services

- [Home Page](https://yango.com/en_int/) — Company overview, mission, and key business areas.
- [Our Services](https://yango.com/en_int/our_services/) — Overview of all Yango services.
- [Yango Rides](https://yango.com/en_int/order/) — Ride-hailing app for fast, safe, and affordable rides. Get a car to your door in minutes with advanced tech.
- [Yango Maps](https://maps.yango.com/) — Easy city navigation; by car, public transport, or on foot. With real-time updates and integrated ride-hailing.
- [Yango Pay](https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/yango-taxi-food-delivery/id1437157286) — Handy e-wallet within the Yango app: easy top-ups, fee-free payments, and cashless transactions.
- [Yasmina AI assistant](https://yasmina.yango.com) — Human-like AI assistant fluent in Arabic and English, enhancing daily life and integrating with Yango apps.
- [Yango Play](https://play.yango.com) — AI-powered entertainment with video, music, and mini-games. Ad-free, and personalized for you.
- [Food Delivery](https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/yango-taxi-food-delivery/id1437157286) — Fast delivery from local stores, cafes, and restaurants, with real-time order tracking.
- [Buy & Sell](https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/yango-taxi-food-delivery/id1437157286) — Marketplace for consumers and businesses with secure payments, trusted sellers, and quick delivery.
- [Goya by Yango](https://apps.apple.com/ae/app/yango-taxi-food-delivery/id1437157286) — Premium ride-hailing brand for those seeking aesthetics. Spacious cars, top-tier drivers, and exclusive perks.
- [About Yango](https://yango.com/en_int/who_we_are) - Yango Group is a tech ecosystem that provides digital services designed to make everyday life easier.

